OL,3,APeople long for simpler times, say
OL,4,APractical Magic reboot stars
OL,5,
OL,6,FMix together a beloved film simmering
OL,7,Ffor decades, a sprinkling of social
OL,8,Fmedia hype and a generous glug of star
OL,9,Fpower and you just might conjure up the
OL,10,Flong-awaited sequel to Practical Magic.
OL,12,FThe 1998 fantasy romcom, starring
OL,13,FSandra Bullock and Nicole Kidman as
OL,14,Fwitchy sisters Sally and Gillian Owens,
OL,15,Freceived mixed reviews from critics
OL,16,Fwhen it was first released.
OL,18,FBut it's put a spell on a new
OL,19,Fgeneration discovering it online, with
OL,20,Fsome now regarding the film as a cult
OL,21,Fclassic and autumn staple.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
