OL,3,APeople long for simpler times, say
OL,4,APractical Magic reboot stars
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe demand for a follow-up by this new
OL,7,Fwave of fans helped convince Bullock
OL,8,Fand Kidman to reprise their roles
OL,9,Fnearly 30 years on, they say.
